{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seaside Diner is a relaxing business game that combines restaurant simulation with table pet gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll open a small seaside restaurant:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 Go fishing, set up crab pots, and harvest fresh ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Grow vegetables in planters to unlock more recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf73 Cook delicious dishes to attract customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike typical business simulation games, Seaside Diner features a &quot;table pet&quot; that stays permanently at the bottom of your screen. It won't block your windows or interfere with your work or study. Instead, it acts like a quiet companion, accompanying you through every moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're catching a fish during a quick break or harvesting crops during a busy day, you'll gradually build a successful restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and let the sea breeze and delicious food embellish your daily life!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3431580?t=1759947504","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3431580?t=1759947504","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/0a11372fe3638d187c8b9a465d6ef93ddb52b8fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759947504","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/0a11372fe3638d187c8b9a465d6ef93ddb52b8fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759947504","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_descripti